<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="command">stomp</ansi>

<ansi fg="command">stomp</ansi> is an alias for <ansi fg="command">kick</ansi>. When your target
is prone, the kick command automatically becomes a stomp.

See <ansi fg="command">help kick</ansi> for full details on all three variants
(kick, stomp, knee).
